Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:15.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're both okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:17.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.85,0:00:28.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She showed up out of nowhere...\Nand killed Mannen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:31.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She said her name was Dot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.23,0:00:36.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mine called herself Hyphen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:39.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She told me to never come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:45.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So... how come you didn't tell us anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.09,0:00:49.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you care now you've cleared it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.65,0:00:51.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because... Because of you, Mannen—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.82,0:00:52.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:54.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What would have changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:55.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if you shielded Mannen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.78,0:00:59.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You would never have made it back, Rika!\NYou'd have been killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.35,0:00:59.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:01.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were just worried about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.98,0:01:09.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you contact us?\NTell us why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.07,0:01:12.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.84,0:01:21.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish I'd never gotten mixed up in this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.79,0:01:27.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you choose this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.97,0:01:28.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neiru.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.78,0:01:32.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was chosen for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.97,0:01:37.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you call out to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.35,0:01:51.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get them back for Mannen, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.23,0:01:56.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.49,0:02:01.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's leave together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:02.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.89,0:02:12.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't even crack your Egg like this, Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:15.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll get you if you don't release Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.22,0:02:19.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.75,0:02:25.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let Leon out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.85,0:02:26.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.99,0:02:29.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} imprinted on them as their mothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.64,0:02:30.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but {\i1}we{\i0} created them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.52,0:02:32.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Acca...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.17,0:02:33.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.66,0:02:41.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.63,0:02:42.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.74,0:02:44.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Break the Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:47.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is your top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:01.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.42,0:03:06.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:08.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.90,0:04:41.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:44.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Acca! Ura-Acca!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:47.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with the term "parallel world"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:50.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only in comic books.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.09,0:04:52.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They actually exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:57.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When someone makes an important\Nchoice, or when they don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.31,0:05:01.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,another {\i1}them{\i0} is created in a different, divergent space-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:06.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but in a different\Nspace-time, the Ai you see there...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:10.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You killed yourself, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.44,0:05:15.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:19.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to apologize. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:24.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because of our eyes, you were \Nbullied and always on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.19,0:05:29.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't talk to Mom or anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.61,0:05:33.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even Koito?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.07,0:05:35.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.31,0:05:38.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.16,0:05:44.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm fighting to save my friend Koito.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.59,0:05:46.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.09,0:05:47.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:51.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. You made a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.30,0:05:54.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I have others, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.15,0:05:57.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neiru, Rika, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:05:58.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That many?\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:02.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, you're happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.02,0:06:14.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Super happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:29.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those are Seeno Evils. They're after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.79,0:06:32.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.69,0:06:33.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.86,0:06:35.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You will?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.13,0:06:40.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You see,\NI've gotten stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:44.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Strong enough to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:49.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.38,0:06:51.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.25,0:06:54.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.59,0:06:54.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.24,0:07:44.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:46.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.77,0:07:48.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:54.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.87,0:08:07.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's Koito like?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:11.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's special.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:15.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She talked to me, even though I was bullied.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.19,0:08:16.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.44,0:08:19.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's your precious friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.75,0:08:20.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.23,0:08:26.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about Koito.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:36.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.30,0:08:40.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.\NI'm your mom's fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:58.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:08:59.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:27.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai,\Nwould you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.05,0:09:30.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:38.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.72,0:09:44.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Art is an explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:45.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.87,0:09:46.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.77,0:09:51.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Compliance is such a pain these days!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.29,0:09:55.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How are we teachers supposed to blow off steam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.61,0:09:57.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you aiming?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:05.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.13,0:10:10.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is what happens to students\Nwho disobey their teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:12.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.87,0:10:23.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:26.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not Mr. Sawaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.19,0:10:28.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am Sawaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.94,0:10:31.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm your first love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.74,0:10:32.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.24,0:10:35.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.09,0:10:37.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a lot nicer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.31,0:10:43.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's my public face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.68,0:10:48.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People are easy to fool when you're born handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:51.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a pest!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.51,0:11:03.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a monster that my doubts and suspicions created.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:06.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The real Mr. Sawaki isn't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:08.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.59,0:11:12.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sounds like my public face
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.27,0:11:16.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,has you completely fooled, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:32.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.18,0:12:05.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koito?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.25,0:12:16.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You changed your hairpin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.98,0:12:18.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:23.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it feel gross?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.94,0:12:24.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:26.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.49,0:12:31.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.93,0:12:34.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:36.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.23,0:12:41.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand that you want to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.23,0:12:42.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.19,0:12:46.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As they say, love is blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.90,0:12:49.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew how you felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.79,0:12:53.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.46,0:13:01.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A pure, unsullied love.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.79,0:13:06.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Compared to adult love,\Nit's far more fragile, ephemeral, and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.14,0:13:08.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both you and Koito.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.50,0:13:12.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Adult love is dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.70,0:13:17.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's full of self-interest. Doesn't it make you sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.82,0:13:20.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But one day, you'll end up like that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.73,0:13:21.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sad, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.83,0:13:25.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why you should die before you grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:28.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.58,0:13:31.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A world free from care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.08,0:13:33.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A comfortable world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.30,0:13:35.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Won't you be happy there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.42,0:13:52.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll support you no matter what, Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.20,0:13:55.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You only live once. Enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:58.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the same thing Kotobuki said.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.39,0:14:00.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.17,0:14:01.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.44,0:14:04.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koito...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.49,0:14:09.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you regret it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.89,0:14:11.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.33,0:14:15.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You regret it, don't you, Ai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.28,0:14:19.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.45,0:14:21.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say it out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.99,0:14:23.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shout it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.58,0:14:26.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.64,0:14:30.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to see Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.21,0:15:09.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.63,0:15:31.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten what your mom did?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:37.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She got dazzled by a man and tried \Nto put her own desires first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.83,0:15:40.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so shocked you don't want to admit it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.42,0:15:42.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but even your mom is a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:49.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I stopped going to school, \NMom never blamed me even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.51,0:15:55.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was always worrying about me where\NI couldn't see, so that I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.21,0:15:59.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She said that she'd support me no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.85,0:16:03.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to support her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:05.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I don't, I'd feel bad for Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.25,0:16:09.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're almost pitifully innocent, Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.07,0:16:14.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:17.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You be happy too, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.24,0:16:22.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got my full support.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.83,0:16:25.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:29.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.55,0:16:32.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm done with the me that craved attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:39.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going...\Nto believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.26,0:16:43.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I don't, I can't protect anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.94,0:16:46.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't love anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.94,0:16:49.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the same mouth you asked me out with!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.82,0:16:54.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.06,0:17:05.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.58,0:17:11.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.96,0:17:12.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:13.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.99,0:17:15.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.48,0:17:16.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.01,0:17:18.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.08,0:17:24.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koito!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.25,0:17:35.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great, other me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:42.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can see her again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:48.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I wanted to hear the truth from Koito.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.22,0:17:50.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:51.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:52.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.59,0:17:55.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I feel grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.65,0:17:58.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if she was a fake friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:02.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was saved back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.71,0:18:04.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wasn't alone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.01,0:18:06.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:08.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.10,0:18:11.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to become a warrior of Eros.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.41,0:18:12.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.90,0:18:15.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll fight Thanatos, the temptation of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.02,0:18:18.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to go to parallel worlds yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:21.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but someday, I'll bring you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.12,0:18:24.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your mom is sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.70,0:18:28.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I want to get strong like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.64,0:18:31.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.84,0:18:33.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm you, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.14,0:18:36.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.82,0:18:39.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.86,0:18:42.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.15,0:18:45.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.03,0:18:46.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.20,0:18:49.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:50.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Redi{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.68,0:18:51.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.35,0:18:56.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kirara Rodriguez Matured XVIII Evening Star SS Plum.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.91,0:18:58.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kirara... Long name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.10,0:19:14.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.81,0:19:15.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.46,0:19:17.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me in, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.46,0:19:17.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.10,0:19:20.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her mission is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.10,0:19:20.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll bring my wallet next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.66,0:19:23.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to get even for Mannen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.26,0:19:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With hatred, she'll be taken by Frill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.38,0:19:29.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll never know unless we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.96,0:19:32.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you care what happens to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.76,0:19:33.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She knows the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.27,0:19:39.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't actually care about Frill, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.07,0:19:41.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.42,0:19:44.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as you can save Himari.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.92,0:19:47.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.46,0:19:50.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that how we've always been?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.77,0:19:55.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.12,0:19:56.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.22,0:20:11.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So shiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.26,0:20:22.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The other... me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.21,0:20:26.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She... protected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:32.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.12,0:20:38.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want shiny things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.04,0:20:40.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Shiny"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.76,0:20:47.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.56,0:20:59.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good luck, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.12,0:21:03.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.52,0:21:13.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.46,0:22:48.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
